WEBVTT

00:00:01.640 --> 00:00:07.860
You mustn't call us cute!
kawaii nante sonna koto ittcha dame desu

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:21.910
Fluffy and lighthearted
fuwa fuwa

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:26.170
The strawberry girls are coming
ichigotachi ga yattekuru

00:00:26.170 --> 00:00:30.510
Loud voices are coming closer
urusai koe ga chikazuite kuru

00:00:32.010 --> 00:00:33.800
Fluffy and lighthearted
fuwa fuwa

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:37.970
The strawberry girls are coming
ichigo tachi ga yattekuru

00:00:37.970 --> 00:00:42.520
They smell sweet and sour
amakute suppai kaori ga suru

00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:46.770
It doesn't matter if the colors are mixed up
chiguhagu na iro de iimon

00:00:46.770 --> 00:00:49.520
Let's draw some graffiti
rakugaki shichao

00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:52.860
It's only natural that we'll make mistakes
shippai mo atarimae dayone

00:00:52.860 --> 00:00:57.280
So you'd better forgive us!
watashitachi wo yurushite agenasai!

00:00:58.870 --> 00:01:02.000
Don't get mad, don't get mad
okoranaidene, okoranaide

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:04.790
Just let us do what we want
suki ni sasete ne

00:01:04.790 --> 00:01:07.500
Adults can't understand this
otona niwa wakaranai

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:10.840
Amazing! Miracle! Perfect!
suteki! kiseki! kanpeki!

00:01:10.840 --> 00:01:16.590
You mustn't say we're cute!
kawaii nante sonna koto ittcha dame desu

00:01:16.590 --> 00:01:20.260
Dazzling smiles
totetsumonai egao

00:01:20.260 --> 00:01:22.720
Marshmallow-y sweet girls!
mashimaro na onnanoko

00:01:22.720 --> 00:01:25.480
S-T-R-A-W-B-E-R-R-Y Girl!
I-C-H-I-G-O Girl!

00:01:25.560 --> 00:01:28.480
Go, go, girl! "Strawberry" LOVE
Go, go, girl! "Ichigo" LOVE!

00:01:30.020 --> 00:01:34.990
Birthday

00:01:39.620 --> 00:01:41.620
What lovely weather.

00:01:54.010 --> 00:01:56.380
Ah, nice to meet you.

00:01:56.380 --> 00:01:58.180
I'm Itou Nobue.

00:01:58.970 --> 00:02:02.060
As you can see,
I'm your average 16 year old.

00:02:08.730 --> 00:02:11.730
I'm lying. Despite my girlish looks...

00:02:11.730 --> 00:02:13.900
...I'm a 20-year-old junior-college student.

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:38.090
Well, let me introduce you to the guardian of the treasury...

00:02:38.090 --> 00:02:40.390
Uh... I mean... my cute little sister.

00:02:42.600 --> 00:02:45.770
Hey, Chi, I'm coming in.

00:02:55.980 --> 00:02:57.740
Can you hear me, Chi?

00:03:00.610 --> 00:03:03.320
Oh! She's studying how to make homemade sweets.

00:03:03.320 --> 00:03:04.490
That's my sis!

00:03:05.490 --> 00:03:07.410
Do you have a big belly yet?

00:03:19.970 --> 00:03:22.090
Onee-chan, you have to knock before you come in!

00:03:22.640 --> 00:03:24.470
I did, but you didn't notice.

00:03:24.470 --> 00:03:24.970
Huh?

00:03:24.970 --> 00:03:26.060
Oh, really?

00:03:26.060 --> 00:03:26.970
Sorry.

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:29.890
My little sister Chika. 12-years-old.

00:03:29.890 --> 00:03:31.560
In sixth grade, elementary school.

00:03:31.560 --> 00:03:33.100
Um, her distinguishing trait...

00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:35.650
...is that she doesn't have any real distinguishing traits.

00:03:35.650 --> 00:03:37.230
What's up, Onee-chan?

00:03:37.230 --> 00:03:38.860
Huh? Well...

00:03:39.530 --> 00:03:41.450
Put your leg down and sit properly.

00:03:42.570 --> 00:03:43.530
What?

00:03:44.910 --> 00:03:46.120
See?

00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:47.620
See what?

00:03:47.620 --> 00:03:50.200
You can't get up from this position even if you wanted to, can you?

00:03:50.660 --> 00:03:53.580
Yeah, because you're blocking me.

00:04:05.930 --> 00:04:08.970
You should really learn to use the front door, Micchan.

00:04:11.140 --> 00:04:12.810
What are you guys doing here?

00:04:12.810 --> 00:04:16.730
No, that's what I'm supposed to ask you.

00:04:16.730 --> 00:04:18.780
Onee-chan was just taking a picture of me...

00:04:18.780 --> 00:04:19.940
What!

00:04:22.990 --> 00:04:24.530
Nobue-oneechan, me too!

00:04:24.530 --> 00:04:25.360
"You too" what?

00:04:25.360 --> 00:04:26.950
Take a picture of me too!

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:29.490
These clothes are brand new!

00:04:30.700 --> 00:04:31.660
Okay, okay.

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:34.040
Just a little bit...

00:04:35.580 --> 00:04:38.000
What's with the pleading look on your face?

00:04:38.420 --> 00:04:40.170
It's my pretty girl face.

00:04:40.590 --> 00:04:41.710
So you're a pretty girl, are you?

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:45.590
Hurry up and take it.

00:04:45.590 --> 00:04:46.590
Flat-chested.

00:04:46.590 --> 00:04:47.470
Wha...!

00:04:47.470 --> 00:04:49.060
Our neighbor, Matsuoka Miu.

00:04:49.510 --> 00:04:51.720
She grew up with my sister Chi and is in the sixth grade.

00:04:52.770 --> 00:04:55.940
She's always crossing the roofs and bursting in, just like she did now.

00:04:56.230 --> 00:04:57.690
An excellent snapshot.

00:04:58.230 --> 00:05:00.650
Cheater! No sense of loveliness!

00:05:01.320 --> 00:05:02.280
I'm bored.

00:05:02.280 --> 00:05:04.030
Is there anything interesting to do?

00:05:04.650 --> 00:05:08.450
I've known her for a long time but I still don't get what goes on in her head.

00:05:08.450 --> 00:05:11.410
So, what did you come in here for, Onee-chan?

00:05:11.410 --> 00:05:13.960
Huh? Um...

00:05:13.960 --> 00:05:17.710
There was something I wanted to ask you...
What was it?

00:05:17.710 --> 00:05:20.040
Don't ask me.

00:05:20.040 --> 00:05:23.260
Nobue-oneechan's senility is getting worse and worse...

00:05:23.260 --> 00:05:25.840
Let's see... Um...

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:29.430
I know it's a really important matter.

00:05:29.430 --> 00:05:30.970
I remember!

00:05:30.970 --> 00:05:34.180
You wanted to give Chi-chan and me some spending money!

00:05:34.180 --> 00:05:36.020
Not likely, Micchan.

00:05:36.020 --> 00:05:39.900
More importantly, why are you trying to remember for me?

00:05:39.900 --> 00:05:41.860
Cuz, you said you'd give us some!

00:05:41.860 --> 00:05:43.480
Nobody said that!

00:05:46.070 --> 00:05:49.030
Um... Hello.

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:51.580
<i>Yes, come in.</i>

00:05:55.330 --> 00:05:57.540
Sakuragi Matsuri-chan, who lives in the neighborhood.

00:05:57.540 --> 00:06:00.290
She's 11 and in the 5th grade... Huh?

00:06:01.380 --> 00:06:05.130
And the pudding that I saved and was looking forward to...

00:06:05.130 --> 00:06:07.550
My dad ate it...!

00:06:07.550 --> 00:06:10.640
That was awful of your dad.

00:06:10.640 --> 00:06:14.220
I'll buy you the same pudding next time, so don't cry. Don't cry.

00:06:14.220 --> 00:06:15.180
Okay?

00:06:15.180 --> 00:06:17.560
Th-Thank you, Nobue-oneechan...

00:06:18.140 --> 00:06:20.520
G-Give me pudding too...

00:06:20.520 --> 00:06:21.860
Why?

00:06:21.860 --> 00:06:23.690
Discrimination!
Discrimination based on loveliness!

00:06:26.650 --> 00:06:28.740
Let's see...

00:06:28.740 --> 00:06:31.120
Well, I'll be off now.

00:06:32.120 --> 00:06:34.580
What was your very important matter?

00:06:35.830 --> 00:06:39.040
C-Cigarettes.
That's what it was.

00:06:40.120 --> 00:06:43.880
So, I'm away for just a few seconds and we end up with this situation.

00:06:43.880 --> 00:06:46.510
Micchan hurled herself at Matsuri-chan...

00:06:48.090 --> 00:06:49.590
And before we knew it...

00:06:49.590 --> 00:06:52.930
What's with the garbage can in the middle of your flashback?

00:06:52.930 --> 00:06:53.680
Huh?

00:06:53.680 --> 00:06:55.600
Never mind that.

00:06:56.560 --> 00:06:58.600
In this position, if you try to stand...

00:06:58.600 --> 00:07:00.730
Yeah, what about it?

00:07:07.940 --> 00:07:10.360
Huh? Chi, where's your wallet?

00:07:10.360 --> 00:07:11.610
Hey, wait!

00:07:13.950 --> 00:07:15.830
Because of these financial circumstances...

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:17.200
...I need to borrow a little money.

00:07:17.200 --> 00:07:18.450
I'll pay you back at the end of the month.

00:07:19.410 --> 00:07:20.920
How much do cigarettes cost?

00:07:20.920 --> 00:07:22.210
About 50,000 yen.

00:07:22.210 --> 00:07:23.290
Quit smoking, then.

00:07:23.290 --> 00:07:26.090
Oh, come on. I'm joking.

00:07:26.090 --> 00:07:27.460
It's only about 20,000 yen.

00:07:27.460 --> 00:07:29.010
For just one pack?

00:07:29.010 --> 00:07:31.380
Of course not! I'm gonna buy in bulk!

00:07:31.380 --> 00:07:34.050
I can't keep coming back to you for money, it'd be inappropriate!

00:07:35.050 --> 00:07:37.520
You have to promise you'll give it back to me this month.

00:07:37.720 --> 00:07:39.350
Um?

00:07:40.310 --> 00:07:42.230
You can buy a pack with another 100 yen, right?

00:07:42.480 --> 00:07:43.480
Chiii!!

00:07:43.480 --> 00:07:45.900
Once I get paid, I'm gonna buy all the cigarettes I want!

00:07:45.900 --> 00:07:47.530
After you pay me back that 100 yen!

00:07:48.320 --> 00:07:49.650
Whatever.

00:07:50.700 --> 00:07:52.360
Nobue-oneechan...

00:07:52.360 --> 00:07:54.120
Please help me!

00:07:54.700 --> 00:07:56.580
Oh, that's right.

00:07:56.580 --> 00:07:59.000
<i>This is your weekly paper-recycling...</i>

00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:07.210
By the way, do you guys know what day it is tomorrow?

00:08:07.210 --> 00:08:07.590
Huh?

00:08:07.590 --> 00:08:08.550
Tomorrow?
Huh?

00:08:09.170 --> 00:08:10.210
Dunno.

00:08:10.210 --> 00:08:11.050
I see.

00:08:14.470 --> 00:08:16.600
It's not like it really matters...

00:08:21.680 --> 00:08:23.350
You're getting big, too!

00:08:24.690 --> 00:08:27.270
This is Satake. As you can see...

00:08:27.940 --> 00:08:29.150
...he's a tiger.

00:08:30.320 --> 00:08:31.820
Well, excuse me.

00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:45.040
What's your problem, leaving when I came over here to play?

00:08:45.040 --> 00:08:47.670
Micchan, have you done your homework yet?

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:50.710
What about you, Chi-chan?
I'm finished.

00:08:52.670 --> 00:08:53.720
Show it to me later.

00:08:53.720 --> 00:08:54.930
No.

00:08:56.050 --> 00:09:00.930
Don't you think Sensei is scary when you forget your homework?

00:09:00.930 --> 00:09:02.480
I'm not gonna show you.

00:09:02.480 --> 00:09:05.810
It won't hurt you any if you just let me take a peek!

00:09:05.810 --> 00:09:09.150
No. You always just copy mine word for word.

00:09:09.860 --> 00:09:13.360
Itou and Matsuoka, your answers are exactly the same.

00:09:13.360 --> 00:09:14.860
That's because I copied hers.

00:09:14.860 --> 00:09:16.610
Both of you, go stand in the hall.

00:09:17.110 --> 00:09:19.620
I'm so bored!

00:09:19.620 --> 00:09:21.990
Let's go play!

00:09:21.990 --> 00:09:23.250
Stop it, you!

00:09:37.800 --> 00:09:39.300
Hey!
<i>Masaka
Park</i>

00:09:39.300 --> 00:09:39.760
<i>Masaka
Park</i>

00:09:40.430 --> 00:09:41.970
Look, look! Check it out!

00:09:42.560 --> 00:09:44.850
I bet you can't swing this high!

00:09:44.850 --> 00:09:47.190
Of course not, we'd be too embarassed to swing like that.

00:09:49.520 --> 00:09:51.440
Hey, guys?

00:09:51.440 --> 00:09:54.110
Doesn't it feel like we're forgetting something?

00:09:54.530 --> 00:09:56.610
Like what?

00:09:59.410 --> 00:10:03.830
Actually, didn't Nobue-oneechan say something like that a little while ago?

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:06.410
She asked what day tomorrow was.

00:10:06.410 --> 00:10:08.170
Is there something going on, Matsuri-chan?

00:10:08.620 --> 00:10:10.080
Huh? Um...

00:10:10.790 --> 00:10:14.800
Today is Sunday, right?
So, tomorrow is...

00:10:15.420 --> 00:10:16.630
Monday?

00:10:16.630 --> 00:10:19.680
You're just pretending to be dopey, right, Matsuri-chan?

00:10:20.390 --> 00:10:21.760
Y-Yeah.

00:10:22.100 --> 00:10:23.260
Oh!

00:10:23.260 --> 00:10:24.680
Massachusetts!!

00:10:27.390 --> 00:10:28.190
Chi-chan!

00:10:29.940 --> 00:10:31.060
What date is it today?

00:10:31.060 --> 00:10:33.730
Um, the 17th?

00:10:33.730 --> 00:10:35.650
So, what day is it tomorrow?

00:10:35.650 --> 00:10:37.360
You're an idiot, aren't you?

00:10:38.610 --> 00:10:40.160
Look that way for a second.

00:10:41.990 --> 00:10:44.080
Chi~chan.

00:10:44.790 --> 00:10:45.620
See?

00:10:45.620 --> 00:10:47.830
Uh... See what?

00:10:47.830 --> 00:10:50.040
What do you mean "what"!
Tomorrow is...

00:10:51.420 --> 00:10:54.170
...Nobue-oneechan's birthday!

00:11:06.350 --> 00:11:08.140
Birthday...

00:11:08.770 --> 00:11:10.850
Now that you mention it...

00:11:12.230 --> 00:11:14.610
Why are you being so absent-minded?

00:11:14.610 --> 00:11:19.990
Well, my sister isn't really interested in celebrations and holidays.

00:11:19.990 --> 00:11:22.990
Oh, so it's her birthday tomorrow.

00:11:24.530 --> 00:11:27.370
You have to at least give her a present.

00:11:27.370 --> 00:11:29.080
I don't mind, but...

00:11:29.080 --> 00:11:30.540
I don't have that kind of money.

00:11:30.540 --> 00:11:31.540
What?

00:11:32.040 --> 00:11:35.000
Well, then make something homemade.

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:36.050
Like what?

00:11:36.960 --> 00:11:38.010
Let me think...

00:11:38.960 --> 00:11:43.140
Wh-Why don't we gather flowers and make a hair ornament?

00:11:43.470 --> 00:11:45.600
Not her style!

00:12:00.860 --> 00:12:02.530
Why don't we make an ashtray?

00:12:05.030 --> 00:12:06.240
Good idea.

00:12:06.240 --> 00:12:08.790
The ashtray she has right now is pretty disgusting.

00:12:08.790 --> 00:12:10.000
That might be good!

00:12:10.000 --> 00:12:13.750
And we could write her a birthday card and give it to her along with the present.

00:12:13.750 --> 00:12:15.250
Yeah, that sounds great!

00:12:15.250 --> 00:12:19.550
Yes. But how do we make an ashtray?

00:12:20.800 --> 00:12:23.930
I think we can make it out of paper clay or something.

00:12:23.930 --> 00:12:27.510
I have lots of paper clay!

00:12:27.510 --> 00:12:28.850
Okay, it's decided then!

00:12:28.850 --> 00:12:31.310
Let's do it after school tomorrow.

00:12:31.310 --> 00:12:32.060
Okay.

00:12:32.060 --> 00:12:34.480
What are you guys talking about!

00:12:34.900 --> 00:12:37.900
Not tomorrow, we gotta start today!

00:12:38.360 --> 00:12:39.980
What do you mean, today?

00:12:39.980 --> 00:12:41.900
The day before tomorrow.

00:12:41.900 --> 00:12:45.160
But, it's already so late, and...

00:12:45.160 --> 00:12:47.320
If you say you're gonna do it, you gotta do it right away!

00:12:47.320 --> 00:12:48.620
Commence preparations!

00:12:48.620 --> 00:12:51.040
Gather at Chi-chan's house!

00:12:51.040 --> 00:12:53.540
No way!
For real?

00:13:02.550 --> 00:13:02.920
<b>School Brand
Paper Clay</b>

00:13:02.920 --> 00:13:05.470
Matsuri-chan, did you tell your parents?

00:13:05.470 --> 00:13:06.470
Uh-huh.

00:13:06.470 --> 00:13:09.510
I told them I'd be staying at your house tonight.

00:13:09.510 --> 00:13:12.350
Okay, here's a sample sketch of the ashtray we're going to make today.

00:13:12.350 --> 00:13:13.560
<b>Completed Ashtray!
Yay!
Okay, here's a sample sketch of the ashtray we're going to make today.</b>

00:13:13.560 --> 00:13:16.310
What do you think of this ashtray here?

00:13:16.310 --> 00:13:17.770
It's so cute!

00:13:17.770 --> 00:13:20.110
The least you can do is react to my joke.

00:13:20.980 --> 00:13:22.110
It's your duty.

00:13:25.490 --> 00:13:26.860
You're still playing?

00:13:26.860 --> 00:13:29.370
I told you to knock, Onee-chan!

00:13:29.370 --> 00:13:32.160
Never mind that, it's already six thirty.
You should be...

00:13:32.160 --> 00:13:33.620
I was just about to leave!

00:13:34.540 --> 00:13:36.830
Is it just me, or are you guys really jumpy?

00:13:36.830 --> 00:13:38.420
N-No...

00:13:38.420 --> 00:13:40.540
Matsuri-chan, want me to drop you off at home?

00:13:40.540 --> 00:13:42.960
I'm fine. My house is close anyway.

00:13:43.420 --> 00:13:45.550
Okay. You better go before it gets dark.

00:13:46.430 --> 00:13:47.760
O-Okay.

00:13:47.760 --> 00:13:49.140
Well, I'm off to my part-time job.

00:13:49.140 --> 00:13:51.970
Okay! Good-bye!

00:13:55.520 --> 00:13:57.480
What is up with them?

00:14:02.900 --> 00:14:05.070
All right, Nobue-oneechan is gone.

00:14:06.610 --> 00:14:08.910
My heart's pounding.

00:14:10.450 --> 00:14:12.790
Alright, let's start making the ashtray right now!

00:14:12.790 --> 00:14:14.080
Wait!

00:14:14.370 --> 00:14:15.580
I'm hungry.

00:14:16.330 --> 00:14:18.370
We haven't even started yet!

00:14:18.370 --> 00:14:20.500
Aw, but...

00:14:20.500 --> 00:14:22.590
We need strength to knead the clay...

00:14:22.590 --> 00:14:23.960
...so we need to eat and replenish our energy!

00:14:23.960 --> 00:14:25.920
Then go home and eat.

00:14:25.920 --> 00:14:28.630
We can't waste even a second right now!

00:14:29.340 --> 00:14:32.850
Why can't you just be honest and say you want to eat our food!

00:14:32.850 --> 00:14:34.890
Huh? That's what I was saying.

00:14:35.600 --> 00:14:36.680
Thank you!

00:14:36.680 --> 00:14:38.100
Thanks for the meal!

00:14:38.600 --> 00:14:40.900
I'm full, I'm full.

00:14:41.360 --> 00:14:43.110
Now that my tummy's full...

00:14:43.110 --> 00:14:44.570
...I think I'll take a bath and go to bed!

00:14:44.570 --> 00:14:47.280
Hey, what happened to making the ashtray?

00:14:47.950 --> 00:14:50.320
What? You really wanna make it?

00:14:50.320 --> 00:14:52.530
It was your idea!

00:14:52.530 --> 00:14:54.490
We're doing this for Nobue-oneechan!

00:14:54.490 --> 00:14:55.790
Let's do our best!

00:14:56.080 --> 00:14:58.660
Matsuri-chan is sure enthusiastic!

00:14:58.660 --> 00:15:01.460
You really should follow her example!

00:15:02.130 --> 00:15:04.210
You're the one who should follow her example! You...!

00:15:11.340 --> 00:15:13.390
You're just gonna roll up your sleeves and that's it?

00:15:14.100 --> 00:15:18.390
S-Sorry. This is the time that I usually get ready for bed.

00:15:18.390 --> 00:15:20.350
Well, I can't blame you, but...

00:15:21.020 --> 00:15:23.480
What are you writing, Micchan?

00:15:31.070 --> 00:15:34.530
<b>Don't Sleep!
By Matsuoka Miu,
6th Grade Class 2</b>

00:15:34.780 --> 00:15:37.540
Wow, you're finally serious, aren't you Micchan!

00:15:37.540 --> 00:15:40.000
This is for Nobue-oneechan, so of course I'm serious!

00:15:42.290 --> 00:15:43.330
Work hard now.

00:15:45.130 --> 00:15:46.670
Shall we pull her out on 1, 2, 3?

00:15:46.670 --> 00:15:47.340
Okay.

00:16:03.850 --> 00:16:04.690
Ou...

00:16:04.690 --> 00:16:05.310
...ch!

00:16:06.150 --> 00:16:08.320
What was that for?

00:16:08.320 --> 00:16:10.530
If you fall asleep again,
I'll show no mercy!

00:16:11.070 --> 00:16:11.780
When did you have time to prepare that?

00:16:11.780 --> 00:16:13.740
<b><i>If they goof up, just give them a whack!</i>
When did you have time to prepare that?</b>

00:16:13.740 --> 00:16:13.990
When did you have time to prepare that?

00:16:13.990 --> 00:16:14.780
Right now.

00:16:14.780 --> 00:16:16.450
Make the ashtray! The ashtray!

00:16:20.750 --> 00:16:23.040
Matsuri-chan! Matsuri-chan!

00:16:25.880 --> 00:16:27.210
Micchan!

00:16:29.590 --> 00:16:32.760
I wasn't sleeping, I was just unconscious.

00:16:32.760 --> 00:16:34.220
That's the same thing!

00:16:36.680 --> 00:16:38.260
I'm going to wash my face.

00:16:39.430 --> 00:16:41.310
Me too.

00:16:41.310 --> 00:16:42.390
Together...

00:16:46.190 --> 00:16:48.770
Onee-chan

00:16:53.200 --> 00:16:54.780
Don't fall asleep!

00:16:56.620 --> 00:17:00.450
I told you if you sleep I'll show no mercy and hit you with this fan!

00:17:00.450 --> 00:17:02.830
Are you prepared for your punishment?

00:17:02.830 --> 00:17:04.290
Okay, no mercy!

00:17:04.790 --> 00:17:05.790
<b>Don't Sleep!
By Matsuoka Miu,
6th Grade Class 2</b>

00:17:05.790 --> 00:17:08.000
<b>4    8    6
Ranking: Number of hits with the fan</b>

00:17:08.250 --> 00:17:10.710
Coffee is good for staying awake!

00:17:11.050 --> 00:17:13.090
Well, that's what Onee-chan told me once.

00:17:14.380 --> 00:17:16.840
Is this stuff really going to wake us up?

00:17:16.840 --> 00:17:17.970
I dunno.

00:17:21.970 --> 00:17:22.980
What do you think?

00:17:22.980 --> 00:17:24.310
So bitter!

00:17:24.310 --> 00:17:24.940
B-But...

00:17:25.390 --> 00:17:28.060
I think I'm a little less sleepy.

00:17:28.060 --> 00:17:29.110
I think so too.

00:17:29.110 --> 00:17:33.030
It must be nice being dumb.
You're easily convinced...

00:17:40.120 --> 00:17:43.120
<b>9    23    8
Ranking: Number of hits with the fan</b>

00:17:43.540 --> 00:17:45.000
On to our next move...

00:17:45.870 --> 00:17:48.000
Fight our sleepiness with cold ice!

00:17:49.630 --> 00:17:50.840
It'th cold.

00:17:50.840 --> 00:17:54.050
Is thith really gonna work?

00:17:54.050 --> 00:17:56.510
It'th better than nothing.

00:18:05.980 --> 00:18:07.440
Gross!

00:18:07.440 --> 00:18:08.440
Huh?

00:18:14.110 --> 00:18:15.490
Wake up!

00:18:16.280 --> 00:18:20.450
Aren't you embarrassed that you're succumbing to sleepiness?!

00:18:20.450 --> 00:18:21.830
That would be you.

00:18:23.950 --> 00:18:25.410
I won't lose.

00:18:26.410 --> 00:18:28.170
There is something called a reflex, right?

00:18:28.960 --> 00:18:31.340
Wh-What?

00:18:31.340 --> 00:18:32.790
For example...

00:18:34.460 --> 00:18:37.090
One... Two... Whack!

00:18:39.220 --> 00:18:44.350
When you hit the shin like that, your leg kicks up against your will.

00:18:44.350 --> 00:18:46.140
But that's her knee.

00:18:46.430 --> 00:18:49.440
I won't lose to something like that.

00:18:50.100 --> 00:18:51.650
Try hitting it. Go on!

00:18:52.400 --> 00:18:53.860
Alright, let's see...

00:18:59.320 --> 00:19:01.370
You're losing big time!

00:19:01.370 --> 00:19:02.530
Damn!

00:19:02.530 --> 00:19:05.330
It's not a matter of winning or losing!

00:19:05.330 --> 00:19:08.120
Okay, I get it.
Let's just finish the present, Micchan.

00:19:08.120 --> 00:19:09.960
Yes, we've only got a little way to go!

00:19:12.750 --> 00:19:13.920
Forehead-flicking Time!

00:19:13.920 --> 00:19:15.210
More chili peppers in the eyes.

00:19:15.210 --> 00:19:16.760
Stop it!

00:19:22.010 --> 00:19:24.470
Itou Family Residence

00:19:31.140 --> 00:19:32.400
So tired.

00:19:54.290 --> 00:19:56.960
Those kids. Oh, well.

00:19:56.960 --> 00:19:57.800
Hey!

00:19:58.460 --> 00:19:59.720
What time do you think it...

00:20:22.280 --> 00:20:23.910
Nobue-oneechan!

00:20:26.580 --> 00:20:28.410
Happy!

00:20:31.200 --> 00:20:32.460
Birthday!

00:20:34.500 --> 00:20:37.460
They didn't have to work so hard, all the way into the middle of the night.

00:20:39.840 --> 00:20:41.800
Note: To Nobue-oneechan, who has gained weight lately.

00:21:00.360 --> 00:21:02.610
Hey, Onee-chan!

00:21:02.610 --> 00:21:04.400
Why didn't you wake me up?

00:21:04.400 --> 00:21:05.660
I'm gonna be late for sch...

00:21:10.950 --> 00:21:14.080
I'm gonna say we totally slept in, so we're skipping school.

00:21:14.660 --> 00:21:16.290
Cut it out.

00:21:16.290 --> 00:21:18.880
Sensei doesn't have a sense of humor.

00:21:19.210 --> 00:21:21.130
A line like that would make anyone furious.

00:21:21.130 --> 00:21:22.510
That's what I'm saying!

00:21:23.920 --> 00:21:26.300
What are you grinning for?

00:21:26.300 --> 00:21:27.260
Nothing.

00:21:28.260 --> 00:21:29.930
Oh, 30 minutes have gone by...

00:21:31.470 --> 00:21:32.850
I'm off!

00:21:34.680 --> 00:21:36.350
Matsuri-chan!

00:21:37.810 --> 00:21:38.810
Let's go.

00:21:39.650 --> 00:21:40.690
Uh, okay.

00:21:41.190 --> 00:21:41.900
Um...

00:21:41.900 --> 00:21:42.610
Huh?

00:21:42.610 --> 00:21:43.740
Chika-chan, what's with your ch...

00:21:43.740 --> 00:21:46.950
It's another beautiful day today!

00:21:46.950 --> 00:21:48.620
Hurry, Chi-chan!

00:21:50.490 --> 00:21:51.950
Runaway Child

00:21:51.950 --> 00:21:57.210
Note: To all you girls:
Thanks for the shabby ashtray.

00:22:15.640 --> 00:22:26.030
When I remembered my forgotten dream
wasurekaketa yume wo omoidashitara

00:22:27.110 --> 00:22:37.290
Suddenly your smile came to mind
fui ni kimi no egao ga ukandekitayo

00:22:37.790 --> 00:22:43.840
Without even thinking about tomorrow
ashita sae mada shiranai

00:22:43.840 --> 00:22:49.260
We used to play all day
nee asonde bakari ita ano hi

00:22:50.010 --> 00:22:55.180
Even when there was a steep downhill
kyuuna sakamichi demo

00:22:55.180 --> 00:23:03.400
We ran as we pretended to have no fear
nee heiki na furi shite hashitta

00:23:03.860 --> 00:23:07.030
Hurry! Hurry!
isoide isoide

00:23:07.030 --> 00:23:14.740
A naughty shadow whispers in your ear
mimimoto de sasayaku itazura kageboshi

00:23:15.120 --> 00:23:18.410
Our skirts fluttered
sukaato yurameki

00:23:18.410 --> 00:23:23.460
As a cool breeze tapped our knees
suzukaze ga hiza wo tataita

00:23:23.840 --> 00:23:34.680
Where are you right now?
anone kimi wa ima doko ni imasuka?

00:23:40.520 --> 00:23:41.730
Big news, big news!

00:23:41.730 --> 00:23:44.770
There's a new student coming to our school from across the ocean.

00:23:44.770 --> 00:23:45.820
Yeah, I know.

00:23:45.820 --> 00:23:47.110
She's in the 5th grade, class 2, right?

00:23:47.110 --> 00:23:49.820
Oh, that's the same class as Matsuri-chan!

00:23:49.820 --> 00:23:52.070
I wonder if we'll all get along?

00:23:52.070 --> 00:23:54.870
Well, she immediately rejected the school lunch...

00:23:54.870 --> 00:23:58.240
And then she entered Nobue-oneechan's "Strike Zone"...

00:23:58.240 --> 00:23:59.790
She's so much trouble!

00:23:59.790 --> 00:24:01.500
That's the premonition I have.

00:24:01.500 --> 00:24:03.120
Do something, Chi-chan!

00:24:03.120 --> 00:24:04.250
Uh, like what?

00:24:05.630 --> 00:24:08.630
Watch the next "Marshmallow"!
